  <diagram id="astro-pages-1" name="01 — Exact local Pages payload handoff">
    <mxGraphModel dx="1200" dy="760" grid="1" gridSize="10" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1200" pageHeight="760">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <mxCell id="title" value="01 — Exact local Pages payload handoff" style="text;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=27;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#142B3A;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="25" width="1120" height="45" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="subtitle" value="A trusted source ZIP pin and independent frozen content precede a complete deployment-format archive." style="text;html=0;align=left;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=15;fontColor=#43566B;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="78" width="1120" height="42" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="b1" value="01  Trusted frozen inputs&#10;&#10;Approved public package + exact request&#10;Candidate ZIP + trusted retained hash&#10;No CMS settings / SQL / network&#10;No caller deployment destination" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=20;fillColor=#F3F8FC;strokeColor=#8AA8C0;fontColor=#142B3A;fontSize=15;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="140" width="340" height="210" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="b2" value="02  Independent Go candidate check&#10;&#10;Exact compressed ZIP digest&#10;Complete path / CRC / byte bounds&#10;Derive expected EN / ID visitor facts&#10;No extraction or new Astro build" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=20;fillColor=#F3F8FC;strokeColor=#8AA8C0;fontColor=#142B3A;fontSize=15;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="430" y="140" width="340" height="210" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="b3" value="03  Canonical in-memory USTAR&#10;&#10;Preserve all regular-file bytes&#10;Sorted names; implicit directories&#10;Mode 0644; UID / GID / time zero&#10;No links / PAX / special members" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=20;fillColor=#F3F8FC;strokeColor=#8AA8C0;fontColor=#142B3A;fontSize=15;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="820" y="140" width="340" height="210" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="b4" value="04  Deterministic gzip + manifest&#10;&#10;Portable fixed metadata&#10;Exact compressed hash and length&#10;Every file name / size / SHA-256&#10;Retain original ZIP + content evidence" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=20;fillColor=#F3F8FC;strokeColor=#8AA8C0;fontColor=#142B3A;fontSize=15;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="820" y="405" width="340" height="210" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="b5" value="05  Independent Node check&#10;&#10;One bounded gzip member + CRC&#10;Every USTAR header and file body&#10;Exact inventory / padding / ending&#10;No extraction / execution / fetching" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=20;fillColor=#F3F8FC;strokeColor=#8AA8C0;fontColor=#142B3A;fontSize=15;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="430" y="405" width="340" height="210" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="b6" value="06  New local output only&#10;&#10;CLI exclusively creates archive file&#10;Public JSON evidence on stdout&#10;Existing files never replaced&#10;Hosted deployment remains pending" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=20;fillColor=#F3F8FC;strokeColor=#8AA8C0;fontColor=#142B3A;fontSize=15;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="405" width="340" height="210" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="footer" value="M5o · 8 November 2026 · Local exact Pages payload · No new migration · Hosted deployment / completion pending" style="text;html=0;align=left;fontSize=14;fontColor=#43566B;" vertex="1" parent="1">
