  <diagram id="astro-pages-2" name="02 — Complete byte and inventory chain">
    <mxGraphModel dx="1200" dy="760" grid="1" gridSize="10" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1200" pageHeight="760">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <mxCell id="title" value="02 — Complete byte and inventory chain" style="text;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=27;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#142B3A;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="25" width="1120" height="45" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="subtitle" value="All assets are covered by integrity checks; public hashes are not authentication or approval." style="text;html=0;align=left;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=15;fontColor=#43566B;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="78" width="1120" height="42" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="b1" value="01  Original source identity&#10;&#10;Trusted expected whole ZIP SHA-256&#10;Match frozen exact release request&#10;Go derives public project / Profile&#10;Malformed / wrong source fails" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=20;fillColor=#F3F8FC;strokeColor=#8AA8C0;fontColor=#142B3A;fontSize=15;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="140" width="340" height="210" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="b2" value="02  Preserve binary + empty files&#10;&#10;Images / fonts / CSS / JavaScript&#10;Exact content including zero bytes&#10;Every file appears once in manifest&#10;Empty directories omitted only" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=20;fillColor=#F3F8FC;strokeColor=#8AA8C0;fontColor=#142B3A;fontSize=15;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="430" y="140" width="340" height="210" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="b3" value="03  Bounded wrappers&#10;&#10;8 MiB ZIP; 32 MiB expanded&#10;256 entries; ordinary USTAR subset&#10;Finite TAR / gzip / manifest sizes&#10;15-second local context checks" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=20;fillColor=#F3F8FC;strokeColor=#8AA8C0;fontColor=#142B3A;fontSize=15;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="820" y="140" width="340" height="210" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="b4" value="04  Reject ambiguous archives&#10;&#10;Links / PAX / unsafe paths / aliases&#10;Mode / owner / time substitutions&#10;CRC / body / padding mismatch&#10;Multiple gzip members / extra tails" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=20;fillColor=#F3F8FC;strokeColor=#8AA8C0;fontColor=#142B3A;fontSize=15;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="820" y="405" width="340" height="210" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="b5" value="05  Separate proof responsibilities&#10;&#10;Go: frozen visitor semantics + ZIP&#10;Node: compressed payload + all files&#10;Manifest must come from trusted Go&#10;No general malware certification" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=20;fillColor=#F3F8FC;strokeColor=#8AA8C0;fontColor=#142B3A;fontSize=15;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="430" y="405" width="340" height="210" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="b6" value="06  Future deployment authority&#10;&#10;Public manifest is unsigned data&#10;Pin to retained current server proof&#10;Repeat Owner / source / target fences&#10;Separate protected provider mutation" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=20;fillColor=#F3F8FC;strokeColor=#8AA8C0;fontColor=#142B3A;fontSize=15;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="405" width="340" height="210" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="footer" value="M5o · 8 November 2026 · Local exact Pages payload · No new migration · Hosted deployment / completion pending" style="text;html=0;align=left;fontSize=14;fontColor=#43566B;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="665" width="1120" height="45" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
